@startuml uml-state-agreement-lifecycle
title Agreement lifecycle — UML state machine

[*] --> Requested
Requested --> Matched: [match found]
Requested --> Rejected: [no match]
Matched --> Active: [auto-approval]
Matched --> PendingApproval: [approval required]
PendingApproval --> Active: [approved]
PendingApproval --> Rejected: [denied / timeout]
Active --> Fulfilled: [purpose completed,\nobligations met]
Active --> Expired: [validity lapsed]
Active --> Revoked: [revoked by controller]
Fulfilled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]

note bottom of Active
  Revocation and expiry take effect at the next PEP
  checkpoint; running jobs are re-evaluated.
  States mirror the Dataspace Protocol shape.
end note
@enduml
